p2oWlOBuQzeaUECA&oe=6A6C8FEE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "DoVille Trailer Thumb 1440.png", "id": "755854905248627", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982552_755854908581960_2515936280676052565_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=77MEUfMKpMIQ7kNvwHta-G2&_nc_oc=AdoB4Ep04dWi2udUdwpjB9diOwjFtddDGwgciU66xi_-PENb9d9kd3zxGsW90VFTQmg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDS7vymsIoR0o6yGQoF0JiXR7pEfxqE7l6QCbRdw4Y_rg&oe=6A6CB262"}, "display_name": "DoVille", "keywords": [], "long_description": "DoVille is in Early Access.\n\nDoVille Episode 1: Juniper Beach, is here.\nDesigned by a team that includes older, nostalgic adults, DoVille is your VR vacation dream come true.\n\nIncluded in the first download is Juniper Beach, a low poly BEACH and sleuthing adventure. Thrill to easy-to-use activities; catch the mysterious art thief and save the beach, or simply stretch out for an extended stay in the warm, warm sun. Take a dip, water ski, or ride the hot-air balloon. \n\nMore episodes are on the way!\nFor more information (and even a report on the positive brain effects, visit doville dot fun). ", "short_description": "DoVille is in Early Access.\n\nDoVille Episode 1: Juniper Beach, is here.\nHere's one you can hand to Granny. Designed by a team that includes older, nostalgic adults, DoVille is your VR vacation dream come true.\n\nIncluded in the first download is Juniper Beach, a low poly BEACH and sleuthing adventure. Thrill to easy-to-use activities; catch the mysterious art thief and save the beach, or simply stretch out for an extended stay in the warm, warm sun. \n\nMore episodes are on the way!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://projectwhitecard.com/pwc/pwcmont/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://projectwhitecard.com/pwc/pwcmont/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Project Whitecard Digital Inc.", "support_we